  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "elegantly",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E55C056C9E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "One way to change our genes is to make new ones, as Craig Venter has so elegantly shown.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "921F32D4E9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Another is to change our lifestyles.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8FDB104E1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 79,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "you don't have to wait very long",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5336E97D44",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 132,
        "text": "And what we're learning is how powerful and dynamic these changes can be, that you don't have to wait very long to see the benefits.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4731A91467",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "you eat healthier",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26FAAC9C3B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "you manage stress",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "94E42DFD47",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "you exercise",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0F1DB22F1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "you love more",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4447E02A7A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "When you eat healthier, manage stress, exercise and love more, your brain actually gets more blood flow and more oxygen.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F51E7FF1E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "But more than that, your brain gets measurably bigger.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8F9303CD14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "Things that were thought impossible just a few years ago can actually be measured now.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22CB950F15",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "This was figured out by Robin Williams a few years before the rest of us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE18E0DBFA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "you can do",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "779C48CB14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "Now, there's some things that you can do to make your brain grow new brain cells.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5A8D11EEC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 142,
        "text": "Some of my favorite things, like chocolate and tea, blueberries, alcohol in moderation, stress management and cannabinoids found in marijuana.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25911E1E44",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "I'm just the messenger.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5FC6E3CC12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "(Laughter) What were we just talking about?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7940E756F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "(Laughter) And other things that can make it worse, that can cause you to lose brain cells.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EDDCAAE801",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "The usual suspects, like saturated fat and sugar, nicotine, opiates, cocaine, too much alcohol and chronic stress.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7F4B383FC5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "you change your lifestyle",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6EECD68A70",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "Your skin gets more blood flow when you change your lifestyle, so you age less quickly.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B3CCFADFC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "Your skin doesn't wrinkle as much.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "61486247B6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Your heart",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3FBE3DA91E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "Your heart gets more blood flow.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B331F0A341",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E297B4DE3A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "We've shown that you can actually reverse heart disease.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9D7B3B9F7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "clogged arteries",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0046BD9402",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "That these clogged arteries that you see on the upper left, after only a year become measurably less clogged.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8F1E4F194B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 54,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "blue means no blood flow",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B24995F58",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "And the cardiac PET scan shown on the lower left, the blue means no blood flow.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5D702A63A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "A year later -- orange and white is maximum blood flow.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1D79B2C23D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 12,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "02D28DD28C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "We've shown you may be able to stop and reverse the progression of early prostate cancer and, by extension, breast cancer, simply by making these changes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "67970E6389",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "We've found that tumor growth in vitro was inhibited 70 percent in the group that made these changes, whereas only nine percent in the comparison group.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90D9C28F0D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "These differences were highly significant.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93AA21329A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "Your sexual organs",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C78FC53512",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "Even your sexual organs get more blood flow, so you increase sexual potency.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A04D639D4B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 212,
        "text": "One of the most effective anti-smoking ads was done by the Department of Health Services, showing that nicotine, which constricts your arteries, can cause a heart attack or a stroke, but it also causes impotence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "59431F0F25",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Half of guys who smoke are impotent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E393E9FD06",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "How sexy is that?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17533B420F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 67,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "973CF2C466",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "Now we're also about to publish a study -- the first study showing you can change gene expression in men with prostate cancer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "733E6F288C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "This is what's called a heat map -- and the different colors -- and along the side, on the right, are different genes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F2EB36E844",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 70,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "turning on the good genes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "752ED80F4E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 127,
        "endOffset": 166,
        "text": "turning off the disease-promoting genes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6E885A00AB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 167,
        "text": "And we found that over 500 genes were favorably changed -- in effect, turning on the good genes, the disease-preventing genes, turning off the disease-promoting genes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9545652977",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 75,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "new hope",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B7F48F139D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "And so these findings I think are really very powerful, giving many people new hope and new choices.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7DEEC41AAC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 67,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "giving you your genetic profiles",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "65C0DA6537",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 173,
        "text": "And companies like Navigenics and DNA Direct and 23andMe, that are giving you your genetic profiles, are giving some people a sense of, \"Gosh, well, what can I do about it?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "986E8EB120",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 210,
        "text": "Well, our genes are not our fate, and if we make these changes -- they're a predisposition -- but if we make bigger changes than we might have made otherwise, we can actually change how our genes are expressed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "505C5CF891",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F6C53A41CB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
